<title>GREECE: TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP UP TO 396 BPS, 300 VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP UP TO 396 BPS, 300 VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between Greece's 10-year bond over bunds edged up to 396 basis points on Monday from Friday's 395.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also widened to 300 basis points from 295 on Friday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.65%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.69%	396	395 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.61%	404	401 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.65%	300	295 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.36%	329	323 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.33%	332	325 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.19%	246	249 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.46%	319	329 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0905 GMT.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
